  }
  --
  <b>COMMAND AND STDERR</b>
  {#
    Field | Value
    command | ore-engine --input bundle.zip --config cfg.yaml
    exit code | 1
    stderr tail | error: no curve set for currency GBP
    stderr tail | error: run aborted after 3 s
  }
  <b>NODE LOGS</b> | [ Node logs ] (withheld) | Reason: node logs need the super administrator role; your role is reader.
  --
  <b>REPRODUCE</b>
  {#
    Field | Value
    input bundle | s3://ore/in/6f2c19a1.zip | [ Download ]
